--- DISCOVERY 7: Spectral Legendre excess = -s_2(n-3) ---
v_2 range = v_2((n-3)!) = (n-3) - s_2(n-3)
Excess over naive bound (n-3): exactly -s_2(n-3) = -Hamming_weight(n-3)

